			"text": "It was narrated from 'Abdullah bin Mughaffal that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\"None of you should urinate in the place where he bathes, for most Waswas (devilish whispers) [1] come from that.\" [1] I.e., with regard to whether the urine has soiled his body or not",
